<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DURF Dashboards | Progress monitoring for the Dutch Repository Federation</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* SURF Design System tokens, matching durf-project/durf-gantt */
    :root {
      --sds-black: #050E1D;
      --sds-white: #FFFFFF;
      --sds-gray-100: #F4F6F8;
      --sds-gray-200: #EAECF0;
      --sds-gray-300: #B2B6BE;
      --sds-gray-400: #8C969F;
      --sds-gray-500: #5E6873;
      --sds-blue-400: #0077C8;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--sds-white);
      color: var(--sds-black);
      font-family: "Source Sans 3", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem;
    }
    .shell { max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; }

    header { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .eyebrow {
      font-weight: 700; font-size: .8125rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sds-blue-400); margin: 0 0 .5rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: Nunito, "Source Sans 3", sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.01em;
      font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 .5rem;
    }
    .intro { max-width: 46rem; color: var(--sds-gray-500); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; }

    main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(17rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }

    .card {
      border: .0625rem solid var(--sds-gray-300);
      border-radius: .375rem;
      background: var(--sds-white);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .card__bar { height: .375rem; background: var(--card-colour, var(--sds-gray-300)); }
    .card__body { padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }
    .card__title {
      font-family: Nunito, "Source Sans 3", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.0625rem;
      margin: 0 0 .5rem; color: var(--sds-black);
    }
    .card__desc { color: var(--sds-gray-500); font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.45; flex: 1; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    .card__image { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-bottom: .0625rem solid var(--sds-gray-200); }

    /* Neutral, always-legible button -- the coloured top bar already ties
       each card to its theme, so button text/border stay a fixed shade
       rather than the theme hue (several DURF theme colours, e.g. the
       theme 2 yellow, don't clear 4.5:1 contrast on white as text). */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border: .0625rem solid var(--sds-gray-400);
      color: var(--sds-gray-500);
      background: var(--sds-white);
      border-radius: .25rem;
      padding: .4rem .9rem;
      font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      align-self: flex-start;
      transition: background-color .15s, color .15s, border-color .15s;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: var(--sds-black); border-color: var(--sds-black); color: var(--sds-white); }

    footer {
      margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: .0625rem solid var(--sds-gray-200);
      color: var(--sds-gray-500); font-size: .8125rem; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    footer a { color: var(--sds-blue-400); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">

    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Dutch Repository Federation</p>
      <h1>DURF Dashboards</h1>
      <p class="intro">Progress monitoring for the six DURF project themes, tracked against the <a href="https://github.com/durf-project/durf-gantt" style="color:var(--sds-blue-400)">project roadmap</a>.</p>
    </header>

    <main>
      {% for notebook in notebooks %}
      <div class="card" style="--card-colour: {{ notebook.colour | default('#B2B6BE') }};">
        <div class="card__bar"></div>
        {% if notebook.image %}
        <a href="{{ notebook.html_path }}">
          <img class="card__image" src="{{ notebook.image }}" alt="{{ notebook.title }} screenshot">
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="card__body">
          <p class="card__title">{{ notebook.title }}</p>
          {% if notebook.description %}
          <p class="card__desc">{{ notebook.description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          <a href="{{ notebook.html_path }}" class="btn">Open dashboard</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>
        Tracking progress on the
        <a href="https://github.com/durf-project/durf-gantt" target="_blank">DURF project roadmap</a>.
        For feedback, <a href="https://github.com/durf-project/dashboards/issues" target="_blank">raise an issue</a>.
        Source under <a href="https://github.com/durf-project/dashboards" target="_blank">durf-project/dashboards</a>,
        licensed under the <a href="https://github.com/durf-project/dashboards/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank">EUPL v1.2</a>.
      </p>
      <p>Built with <a href="https://marimo.io" target="_blank">marimo</a>.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
